      "reason": "Node sidecar runtime (>=20) — runs the bundled ts-morph parser child process. The supervisor execs `node sidecar/dist/index.js` on API start; without Node, the API returns Unavailable on every Extract/RewriteApply call.",
      "when": [
        "setup",
        "develop",
        "production"
      ],
      "notes": "Version constraint: >=20.0.0. Pinned by the sidecar's package.json engines field and the esbuild target in sidecar/scripts/build.mjs."
